Project Initialization:

- Use `npx shadcn@latest init` for project setup.
- Configure `components.json` with proper TypeScript support.
- Set `style: "new-york"` for modern component styling.
- Enable `tsx: true` for TypeScript component generation.
- Configure proper import aliases for project structure.

Component Installation:

- Use `npx shadcn@latest add [component]` for component installation.
- Install components in order of dependencies.
- Use registry blocks for complex UI patterns.
- Override primitives when customizing components.
- Keep components up-to-date with latest versions.

